# Deliberately narrow.
#
# There is no `* text=auto` here. Adding one would renormalise line endings
# across the whole repository in a single commit, which would bury every real
# change in the same diff and make `git blame` useless on every file it touched.
# The CRLF warnings on this machine are cosmetic and stay.

# Compliance evidence is binary and must never be line-ending converted:
# a converted PNG is a corrupt PNG, and these files exist to be opened years
# from now by someone checking whether an agreement was really accepted.
docs/compliance/** binary

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
